error[NK2110]: This `async` starts a task with nothing beside it: nothing beside it in the same call or operation is computed while it runs.
   --> tests/async_task_with_nothing_beside_it.nika:14:2
    |
 14 | 	let r = load(async load(1))
    |  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: A task runs beside the code between its start and its wait point; here that is nothing, so it would only be waited for.
    = help: Remove the word `async`: the expression runs on the main line with the same value.
